.TH WIKI\-SERVER 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
wiki\-server \- Serve the Kingdom wiki as rendered HTML.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wiki\-server
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the Kingdom wiki as rendered HTML.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIN\fR
HTTP server port (default 20002)
.TP
.B \-\-wiki\-dir \fISTRING\fR
Path to wiki markdown directory (default ./wiki)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
wiki\-server
wiki\-server \-\-port 20002 \-\-wiki\-dir ./wiki
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
